  "label": "User projected onto the person experiencing physical exhaustion",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'person' in the image, as the text 'my ass needed a break' explicitly refers to the viewer's own physical state. The phrase 'my ass' uses the first-person possessive pronoun 'my', which directly deictically anchors the experience to the user. The user identifies with the person in the image as the one who has just completed a strenuous activity and is now relieved to rest, making the scene relatable and self-referential. The projection is onto the VisualMaterial entity 'person' and is reinforced by the overall intent of self-deprecating humor and physical exhaustion.",
